# TypeScript & API

## Language

- TypeScript strict; **`any` forbidden**.
- Files ≤ 1000 lines; split modules by domain (`apps/api/src/modules/*`).

## API Shape

```typescript
// Envelope for all REST responses
{ success: true, data: T, error: null }
{ success: false, data: null, error: { code, message, details? } }
```

- Money: decimal strings `"180000.00"` (2 places).
- Dates: ISO 8601 UTC strings.

## License Signing

- Implement in `packages/license-signing`; must match ESC-Promo `license/service.js`.
- `LICENSE_PRIVATE_KEY` — backend only, never frontend bundle.

## MVP Auth

- Single admin user; `requireAuth` on `/api/v1/*` except `/public/*` and `/auth/login`.
- No RBAC middleware or `/users` endpoints in MVP.
